      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.36940002441406,
        486.2922058105469,
        99.22540283203125
      ],
      "text": "8.5\t A -  TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        132.1414031982422,
        86.37620544433594,
        459.9460144042969,
        98.17539978027344
      ],
      "text": "n integrated family oriented approach to addressing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        104.77629089355469,
        188.4182891845703,
        116.57548522949219
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        126.97869873046875,
        489.1033630371094,
        143.70669555664062
      ],
      "text": "TB in pregnancy and management of the newborn of a mother with TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        141.37872314453125,
        129.0673828125,
        158.10671997070312
      ],
      "text": "disease",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        165.11822509765625,
        513.4144287109375,
        178.4697265625
      ],
      "text": "Pregnancy is associated with an increased risk for previously infected women of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        181.11474609375,
        513.4720458984375,
        194.46624755859375
      ],
      "text": "developing TB disease, particularly in the last trimester or the early postnatal period.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        197.11126708984375,
        513.47216796875,
        210.4627685546875
      ],
      "text": "The burden of maternal TB and TB in pregnant women has increased substantially since",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        213.03878784179688,
        513.3915405273438,
        226.45928955078125
      ],
      "text": "(2) the start of the HIV pandemic  : around 2% of HIV-positive pregnant mothers are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        229.10430908203125,
        513.4030151367188,
        242.455810546875
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed with TB, and TB is a major cause of maternal mortality in TB/HIV-endemic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        245.100830078125,
        129.13040161132812,
        258.45233154296875
      ],
      "text": "settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        269.5383605957031,
        486.99896240234375,
        282.9588623046875
      ],
      "text": "(2-5) The increased risks for the newborns of mothers with TB and TB/HIV include  :",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        291.92608642578125,
        266.826904296875,
        305.392578125
      ],
      "text": "infection and disease with TB; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        311.3953857421875,
        296.6233215332031,
        324.86187744140625
      ],
      "text": "mother-to-child transmission of HIV; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        330.8647155761719,
        311.96441650390625,
        344.3312072753906
      ],
      "text": "preterm delivery and low birth weight;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        350.3340148925781,
        263.5953369140625,
        363.8005065917969
      ],
      "text": "perinatal and infant mortality -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        369.8033142089844,
        201.66787719726562,
        383.2698059082031
      ],
      "text": "being orphaned. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        393.13311767578125,
        270.40338134765625,
        409.8611145019531
      ],
      "text": "Management of TB in pregnancy",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        416.87261962890625,
        513.4720458984375,
        430.22412109375
      ],
      "text": "The symptoms of TB disease in pregnancy are similar to those in non-pregnant women,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        432.8691101074219,
        513.3800048828125,
        446.2206115722656
      ],
      "text": "with pulmonary TB being the commonest form of disease. Disseminated TB occurs in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        448.8656005859375,
        513.4718627929688,
        462.21710205078125
      ],
      "text": "5-10% of pregnant woman suffering from TB, and this is a particular risk for congenital",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        464.7930908203125,
        513.4375,
        478.2135925292969
      ],
      "text": "(2 TB  ). All pregnant women in regions endemic for TB/HIV should therefore be screened",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        480.85858154296875,
        513.4721069335938,
        494.2100830078125
      ],
      "text": "for symptoms of TB. It is equally important that a pregnant woman with suspected TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        496.8550720214844,
        173.014404296875,
        510.2065734863281
      ],
      "text": "be tested for HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        521.2926025390625,
        513.448974609375,
        534.7130737304688
      ],
      "text": "(3) Maternal TB increases the risk of mother-to-child transmission (MTCT) of HIV  . If",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        537.3580932617188,
        513.3914184570312,
        550.7095947265625
      ],
      "text": "TB is diagnosed, treatment must be started promptly to prevent transmission and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        553.3545532226562,
        510.20611572265625,
        566.7060546875
      ],
      "text": "improve outcome. The treatment of TB in pregnant women is similar to that for non-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        569.3510131835938,
        513.448974609375,
        582.7025146484375
      ],
      "text": "pregnant women (with the exception of streptomycin, which is not recommended in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        585.278564453125,
        161.5259246826172,
        598.6990356445312
      ],
      "text": "(6) pregnancy)  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        609.8540649414062,
        510.1712646484375,
        623.20556640625
      ],
      "text": "HIV-positive pregnant women with TB are treated with ART according to WHO guide-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        625.7815551757812,
        129.1418914794922,
        639.2020263671875
      ],
      "text": "(7) lines  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        652.044921875,
        247.06338500976562,
        668.77294921875
      ],
      "text": "Congenital and neonatal TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        675.784423828125,
        513.4376220703125,
        689.1359252929688
      ],
      "text": "Congenital TB is TB acquired in utero, through haematogenous spread via the umbilical",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        691.7809448242188,
        513.4376220703125,
        705.1324462890625
      ],
      "text": "vessels, or at the time of delivery through aspiration or ingestion of infected amniotic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        707.7774047851562,
        513.403076171875,
        721.12890625
      ],
      "text": "fluid or cervico-vaginal secretions. Congenital TB usually presents in the first 3 weeks of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        723.77392578125,
        209.63037109375,
        737.1254272460938
      ],
      "text": "life and mortality is high.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        748.2803955078125,
        513.403076171875,
        761.6318969726562
      ],
      "text": "Neonatal TB is TB acquired after birth through exposure to an infectious case of TB -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        764.2769165039062,
        366.8123779296875,
        777.62841796875
      ],
      "text": "usually the mother but sometimes another close contact.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "80",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}